    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i got this weird ache in my stomach. it started out right around my belly button like a few hours ago but now it feels like it moved a bit lower and to the right side. its kinda dull but it's definitely there. u think its just gas or something? can i just take some advil and try to sleep it off?",
