    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not really getting worse though, it's just staying the same. i'm pretty sure it's just something i ate. i'm kinda nauseous but i think if i just lay down and take some more ibuprofen it'll settle. you think it's really worth a doctor visit if the pain is staying pretty steady like this? i'm feeling a bit better just resting.",
